  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police reform programme - Crime intelligence 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polisreformprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme with 3 components: development of the reform strategy and action plan for the Ministry of Interior, development of the system for crime scene and forensic training and establishment of a forensic training centre and development of the capacities for  intelligence-led policing with the aim to establish Criminal Intelligence Service within the MoI. Inception phase lasts 12 months.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet inkluderra tre komponenter, en forts&#xe4;ttning av st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r brottsplatsunders&#xf6;kningar, fortsatt st&#xf6;d till kriminell underr&#xe4;ttelseverksamhet, samt st&#xf6;d till inrikesministeriet f&#xf6;r att arbeta fram en strategi f&#xf6;r polisreform i Serbien</narrative>
  </description>
